--- query
MATCH (a:person)-[:knows]->(b:person)-[:knows]->(c:person) WHERE a.ID = 0 AND b.ID = 2 UNWIND a.usedNames as x RETURN x,a.fName,b.fName,c.fName
--- expected
Aida|Alice|Bob|Alice
Aida|Alice|Bob|Carol
Aida|Alice|Bob|Dan
